1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,248
My bank account drops fifty dollars every single time I tell a stranger to have a wonderful day.

2
00:00:07,548 --> 00:00:14,676
Kindness is an expensive luxury in this city, draining my savings account faster than rent ever could.

3
00:00:14,976 --> 00:00:23,016
Yesterday I praised my coworker's new haircut, and my checking balance vanished entirely into thin air.

4
00:00:23,316 --> 00:00:31,644
So today I decided to stay completely silent, watching the world crumble around me without a single word.

5
00:00:31,944 --> 00:00:39,864
To my complete astonishment, the silence made my bank app ping with massive, unearned cash deposits.

6
00:00:40,164 --> 00:00:47,052
Every cold glare I throw at a crying child adds hundreds of dollars straight to my wallet.

7
00:00:47,352 --> 00:00:53,688
I am getting richer by the minute simply by hating everyone who crosses my path today.

8
00:00:53,988 --> 00:01:01,980
Then the app flashed a terrifying alert revealing the horrific truth behind my sudden financial success.

9
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:08,544
The money was never mine to begin with; it was the stolen life force of people I ignored.

10
00:01:08,844 --> 00:01:18,228
Now my pockets overflow with gold, while my soul remains completely, irreversibly, and terrifyingly bankrupt.
